  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Crunch Compression for UGC content makes no sense for various reasons, ranging from the performance of uncompressing the textures to providing a worse image quality. Until Unity or VRChat implements a better texture compression technique that's better than LZ that wouldn't be as CPU heavy to decompress, it might be better to start disabling Crunch compression and preventing people from using bad texturing optimization practices.",
